### 0) Health
GET http://localhost:8098/actuator/health

### 1) Seed sample knowledge base articles (creates + indexes)
POST http://localhost:8098/api/demo/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2) Search (semantic)
GET http://localhost:8098/api/search?q=reset%20my%20password&limit=5

### 3) Create a new article (creates + indexes)
POST http://localhost:8098/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "How to rotate API keys safely",
  "content": "Rotate keys monthly. Use dual-key rollout. Keep audit logs. Never paste secrets in tickets.",
  "category": "security",
  "tags": ["api", "security", "keys"]
}

### 4) Search again
GET http://localhost:8098/api/search?q=rotate%20keys&limit=5

### 5) List articles
GET http://localhost:8098/api/articles
